/*
 * Copyright 2026 Andrija Panic and the OpenVDDK contributors
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 *
 * Dynamic symbol surface of libvixDiskLib.so.8.0.3.
 *
 * Version nodes, their parent chain and the node each public function is
 * bound to reproduce the reference library (docs/observations/ABI-0001).
 * Consumers linked against the reference record these versions in their
 * DT_VERNEED, so the binding is part of the ABI. Everything else, including
 * the Go runtime and the cgo bridge, stays local.
 *
 * The three reference-internal exports (SetConfigOption, SetInjectedFault,
 * IsFaultEnabled_Func) are deliberately absent until investigated; see
 * COMPATIBILITY.md.
 */

